<title>USA: SCP Pool Corp Q3 shr dil $0.50 vs $0.61.</title>
<headline>SCP Pool Corp Q3 shr dil $0.50 vs $0.61.</headline>
<dateline>COVINGTON, La. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						     September 30,</p>
<p>						   1996	     1995(a)</p>
<p> Net sales			   $  62,344,000     $ 47,229,000</p>
<p> Net income				2,168,000	    899,000</p>
<p>Net income per share:  </p>
<p>   Primary					0.51		 0.64</p>
<p>   Fully diluted				0.50		 0.61</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  4,308,000	  1,486,000</p>
<p>						    Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>						     September 30,</p>
<p>						   1996	    1995(a)</p>
<p> Net sales			   $ 189,356,000     $139,742,000</p>
<p> Net income				7,861,000	  4,080,000</p>
<p>Net income per share:</p>
<p>   Primary					1.86		 2.91</p>
<p>   Fully diluted				1.82		 2.75</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  4,308,000	  1,486,000 (a)</p>
<p>On a pro forma basis (assuming certain adjustments, including the effect of the initial public offering and related recapitalization of the Company in October 1995), SCP reported income of $1.4 million, or $0.32 fully diluted per share, and $5.5 million, or $1.27 fully diluted per share, for the three and nine months ended September 30, 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
